Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.97,0:00:07.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here it comes, Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.85,0:00:12.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Owie!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.39,0:00:14.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A-Are you okay, Bell?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.11,0:00:17.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.30,0:00:22.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell, you aren't very... athletic, are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.12,0:00:25.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.71,0:01:29.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The people in this world\Nstudy all sorts of things.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.80,0:01:32.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I learned the rules pretty quickly, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.44,0:01:34.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Gym class isn't my forte either.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.89,0:01:37.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sports like this are more about\Nmuscle memory, anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:37.69,0:01:39.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell, are you alright?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.06,0:01:41.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.90,0:01:45.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to play volleyball\Nwhen I just want to hang out with you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.65,0:01:46.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, now...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.83,0:01:50.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It makes me happy\Nto see you trying your best.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.18,0:01:52.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel like you're adjusting to\Nthe way things work around here.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:52.92,0:01:55.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had hoped you'd impress me even more...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.34,0:01:58.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alright then...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.92,0:02:00.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.95,0:02:03.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes on me.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.27,0:02:04.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.60,0:02:20.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's using magic...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.39,0:02:23.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I guess it's okay so long as\Nshe's having a good time.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.39,0:02:22.10,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,Set the ball, Sakura!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.10,0:02:23.25,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,G-Got it!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.00,0:02:30.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell! You alright?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.86,0:02:33.61,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can be a little clumsy.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.61,0:02:35.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's nothing. I'm totally fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.42,0:02:37.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, you're not!\NYour ankle needs treatment!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.67,0:02:39.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's get you to the nurse's office. C'mon!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.91,0:02:42.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.92,0:02:46.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mochida, let the teacher know for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.25,0:02:47.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,S-Sure thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.04,0:02:53.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that better?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.19,0:02:56.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.\NIt doesn't hurt at all anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.35,0:02:59.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.\NIt was my fault for pressuring you.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.43,0:03:00.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.97,0:03:04.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If anything, I'm lucky I get to\Nspend some time alone with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.41,0:03:07.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't like seeing you hurt, Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.31,0:03:11.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.16,0:03:13.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.22,0:03:17.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can do anything with you by my side.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.05,0:03:19.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nothing scares me when you're around...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.83,0:03:22.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So stay with me forever...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.03,0:03:24.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't pay attention to anyone else.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.28,0:03:26.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hi-na-ta...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.06,0:03:27.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.59,0:03:28.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.29,0:03:32.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,J-Jeez, she's intense...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.21,0:03:35.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know! Do the magic spell!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.35,0:03:36.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What spell?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.65,0:03:38.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I read about it in one of those books.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.85,0:03:41.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It said you have a magic spell\Nfor making pain go away.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.35,0:03:44.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...Oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.07,0:03:47.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Boo-boos, go away!"
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.02,0:03:48.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.58,0:03:50.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That sucked!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.68,0:03:52.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Say it like you mean it!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.47,0:03:54.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? But, uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.76,0:03:56.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, my poor foot!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.43,0:03:58.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I may never walk again!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.59,0:04:02.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'll have to take care of me\Nfor the rest of my life or else I'll die!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.04,0:04:05.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-Okay, fine!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.71,0:04:08.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go on, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.63,0:04:14.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,May this take away the pain,\Nif only a little...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.96,0:04:18.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And may you never get injured again...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.76,0:04:22.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not enough. More.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.69,0:04:25.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,M-More? Okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.11,0:04:34.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell, your legs... They're beautiful...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.43,0:04:37.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata, kiss me here, too...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.83,0:04:39.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.20,0:04:44.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your skin is so smooth...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.24,0:04:47.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't want any cuts or scars\Nto tarnish it...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.49,0:04:50.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're the only one\Nallowed to say that to me...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.39,0:04:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell...!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.13,0:04:57.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A-Are you not wearing a...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.10,0:04:58.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.21,0:04:59.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Too uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.43,0:05:01.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And it's so that you can touch me\Nwhenever you want.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.86,0:05:03.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.14,0:05:06.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata... do the magic spell on my chest...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.47,0:05:10.61,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell, I...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.08,0:05:15.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry! Did I hurt you?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.54,0:05:16.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.88,0:05:18.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do as you please.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.54,0:05:20.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.87,0:05:29.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell, are you okay?\NI brought you a change of clothes—
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.18,0:05:36.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry for barging in!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.92,0:05:37.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey—!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.42,0:05:40.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mochida, wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.28,0:05:41.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mochida!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.98,0:05:46.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I almost had him...!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.16,0:05:54.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry for bothering you\Non our day off, Mochida.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.12,0:05:57.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No problem.\NI wanted to go shopping, anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.54,0:06:00.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought we were going on a date today...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.59,0:06:02.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why is Sakura here...?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.13,0:06:05.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because I'm a guy,\Nand I lack expertise in this area.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.28,0:06:09.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For your sake, I figured it'd be better for\Nsomeone who has experience to go with us.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.33,0:06:15.56,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.\NIt's your way of looking out for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.56,0:06:17.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay then!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.00,0:06:21.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case, I won't hesitate to\Nshop till I drop—for you, Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.55,0:06:23.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So big...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.94,0:06:27.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Picking out underwear is something\Nonly a girl would understand...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.94,0:06:25.93,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,The design is important, for sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.93,0:06:27.90,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,But choosing the right size is crucial.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.35,0:06:30.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Give us a few minutes, 'kay?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.88,0:06:32.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.79,0:06:43.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They all look great on you!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.55,0:06:45.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What kind do you wear, Sakura?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.58,0:06:46.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.83,0:06:52.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, that one's cute, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.27,0:06:55.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is embarrassing...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.75,0:06:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no need to be shy\Nsince we're both girls, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.25,0:07:00.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess so...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.52,0:07:03.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Sunohara prefers\Nbig over small...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.46,0:07:06.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know! Let's go get Hinata's opinion!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.24,0:07:07.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, Bell—!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.10,0:07:08.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Check it out, Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.49,0:07:09.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.55,0:07:11.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you think? Cute, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.69,0:07:14.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-You can't walk out into the store\Nlooking like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.48,0:07:16.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aw, you don't like this one?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.58,0:07:18.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine, I guess I'll pick a different one...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.12,0:07:23.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell! Get back in the fitting room!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.09,0:07:27.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whew, I'm beat.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.59,0:07:30.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We stocked up on plenty of\Nthe essentials, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.80,0:07:33.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A successful trip! Did you have fun?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.34,0:07:35.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mhm, of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.85,0:07:40.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, gotta use the bathroom.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.21,0:07:42.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,'Kay, take your time.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.79,0:07:47.26,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bell? Can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.26,0:07:48.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hm? What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.99,0:07:53.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I should've asked sooner,\Nbut... are you and Sunohara, um...?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.94,0:07:55.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Partners?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.20,0:07:59.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A couple, maybe?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.05,0:08:01.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, that word doesn't feel\Nstrong enough, either...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.63,0:08:03.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, I see...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.29,0:08:04.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But why do you ask?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.92,0:08:07.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No reason, I was just curious!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.03,0:08:08.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.42,0:08:13.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, anyways, Hinata and I were\Ndestined for each other.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.03,0:08:14.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You were?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.24,0:08:20.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata came to my rescue when I was\Nbeing attacked by humans.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.39,0:08:23.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Up until then, I had despised humans...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.92,0:08:28.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But... the moment I laid eyes\Non Hinata, I knew.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.16,0:08:34.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Oh. The whole reason I exist\Nis to be with this person."
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.99,0:08:38.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I've felt the same way ever since.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.28,0:08:47.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, I made up my mind to never leave\NHinata's side ever again.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.08,0:08:51.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's amazing, the way you aren't afraid\Nto say you love him...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.41,0:08:54.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had better step up my game...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.62,0:08:56.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.24,0:08:58.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-No, it's nothing!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.83,0:09:00.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.06,0:09:02.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome back, Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.09,0:09:02.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.92,0:09:05.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mochida, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.42,0:09:07.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Nope, I'm fine!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.49,0:09:16.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Should we head home, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.72,0:09:17.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.04,0:09:20.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But before that...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.31,0:09:22.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.18,0:09:26.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you mind if we make a quick detour?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.62,0:09:31.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.17,0:09:33.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize your world\Nhas places like this!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.87,0:09:37.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And the countryside has even more\Ngreenery than the city does.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.45,0:09:39.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But why'd you bring me here?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.92,0:09:43.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's just... It seemed like you needed\Na little pick-me-up.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.71,0:09:48.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess you're right...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.42,0:09:53.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I do feel more at peace when\NI'm surrounded by nature like this...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.03,0:09:54.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.51,0:09:57.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I asked a lot of you\Nwithout considering your feelings...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.64,0:09:58.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.69,0:10:00.61,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.58,0:10:10.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,U-Um... To make up for today,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.09,0:10:13.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I figured we could go on\Na date now, just us two—
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.38,0:10:15.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not enough...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.53,0:10:16.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.37,0:10:20.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It isn't nearly enough, Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.49,0:10:23.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need you to pay more attention to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.09,0:10:24.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ignore everyone else...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.85,0:10:28.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and I'll only ever have eyes for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.17,0:10:29.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.05,0:10:44.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whew, finally found 'em!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.15,0:10:47.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I swear... You haven't changed\Na bit, have you?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.06,0:10:47.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.80,0:10:52.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good to see you again, Lord Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.16,0:10:53.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.51,0:10:55.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Miss Cecil? May?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.53,0:10:56.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But why...?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.37,0:11:02.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're here to bring you back home, Mariabell.
